{"id":"a7fb4b198985f03a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-signedbalancequadratic.md","title":"Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation","display":"thm-signedbalancequadratic — Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-signedbalancequadratic","aliases":["27-thm-signedbalancequadratic"],"display":"thm-signedbalancequadratic — Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation","depends_on":["[[27-df-signedgraph]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.5.3 Equation (5.7)","source_statement":"Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation","source_printed_pages":"220","source_pdf_pages":"244","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-local-encoding-proof"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-signedbalancequadratic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-signedbalancequadratic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-signedbalancequadratic — Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65efe7c4f987bfe\" href=\"?note=d65efe7c4f987bfe\" title=\"27-df-signedgraph\">27-df-signedgraph</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.5.3 Equation (5.7)"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a7fb4b198985f03a\" href=\"?note=a7fb4b198985f03a\" title=\"Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation\">Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"220"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"244"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-local-encoding-proof"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedGraph}((N,P,M))\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedGraph}((N,P,M))\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d65efe7c4f987bfe\" href=\"?note=d65efe7c4f987bfe\" title=\"27-df-signedgraph\">27-df-signedgraph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bal}\\)</span> 为有限符号图上的三元谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_M:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\mathbf1_M:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_{P,M}:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(s_{P,M}:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义；模 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 同余取整数含义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_M(e)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;e\\in M,\\\\0&amp;e\\notin M\\end{cases}\\quad(e\\subseteq N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf1_M(e)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;e\\in M,\\\\0&amp;e\\notin M\\end{cases}\\quad(e\\subseteq N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bal}(N,P,M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in N^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;\\left((v_0=v_r\\land\\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\;(\\{v_t,v_{t+1}\\}\\in P\\cup M))\\Rightarrow\\sum_{t=0}^{r-1}\\mathbf1_M(\\{v_t,v_{t+1}\\})\\equiv0\\pmod2\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bal}(N,P,M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in N^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;\\left((v_0=v_r\\land\\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\;(\\{v_t,v_{t+1}\\}\\in P\\cup M))\\Rightarrow\\sum_{t=0}^{r-1}\\mathbf1_M(\\{v_t,v_{t+1}\\})\\equiv0\\pmod2\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_{P,M}(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in P}(1-a_i(1-a_j))(1-(1-a_i)a_j)\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in M}(1-a_ia_j)(1-(1-a_i)(1-a_j))\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_{P,M}(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in P}(1-a_i(1-a_j))(1-(1-a_i)a_j)\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in M}(1-a_ia_j)(1-(1-a_i)(1-a_j))\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bal}(N,P,M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(s_{P,M}(a)=0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Bal}(N,P,M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(s_{P,M}(a)=0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零方程要求正边两端同值、负边两端异值。沿每个分量选根，以根到顶点路径的负边数奇偶赋值；闭游走奇偶为0保证路径选择无关。反向沿闭游走把端点差相加即消去全部顶点值。书中以 circuits 定义平衡；闭游走版本由分解闭游走成简单圈等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-signedgraph","status":"resolved","id":"d65efe7c4f987bfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-signedgraph]]","embed":false},{"target":"Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation","status":"resolved","id":"a7fb4b198985f03a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-signedgraph","status":"resolved","id":"d65efe7c4f987bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$，$\\mathrm{SignedGraph}((N,P,M))$，见 [[27-df-signedgraph]]；$\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$。$\\mathrm{Bal}$ 为有限符号图上的三元谓词，$\\mathbf1_M:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb B$ 与 $s_{P,M}:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义；模 $2$ 同余取整数含义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedGraph}((N,P,M))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_M:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"s_{P,M}:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_M(e)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&e\\in M,\\\\0&e\\notin M\\end{cases}\\quad(e\\subseteq N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bal}(N,P,M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall r\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in N^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;\\left((v_0=v_r\\land\\forall t\\in\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\;(\\{v_t,v_{t+1}\\}\\in P\\cup M))\\Rightarrow\\sum_{t=0}^{r-1}\\mathbf1_M(\\{v_t,v_{t+1}\\})\\equiv0\\pmod2\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"s_{P,M}(a)\\coloneqq1-\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in P}(1-a_i(1-a_j))(1-(1-a_i)a_j)\\prod_{\\{i,j\\}\\in M}(1-a_ia_j)(1-(1-a_i)(1-a_j))\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n),\\qquad\\prod\\varnothing=1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bal}(N,P,M)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(s_{P,M}(a)=0).","display":true}],"bytes":2128,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-signedbalancequadratic|thm-signedbalancequadratic — Signed graph balance as a quadratic zero equation]]"}],"outgoing":["d65efe7c4f987bfe"]}